WEBVTT

00:00.837 --> 00:01.887
<b>[banner fluttering]</b>

00:01.927 --> 00:05.927
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

00:06.887 --> 00:08.887
<b>[growls]</b>

00:08.937 --> 00:10.517
<b>[thunderclap]</b>

00:14.267 --> 00:15.317
<b>Hmm.</b>

00:18.107 --> 00:19.147
<b>[scoffs]</b>

00:39.047 --> 00:40.217
<b>[ELYMAS] The Heavy Knight.</b>

00:40.257 --> 00:41.257
<b>HEAVY KNIGHT</b>

00:41.677 --> 00:44.967
<b>A densely armored class
that specializes in defense</b>

00:45.007 --> 00:47.807
<b>and draws enemy attacks
to protect allies.</b>

00:47.847 --> 00:51.557
<b>But compared to the many
other defensive classes,</b>

00:51.597 --> 00:53.397
<b>it lacks versatility.</b>

00:54.227 --> 00:56.567
<b>With its weak
offensive abilities,</b>

00:56.607 --> 00:59.437
<b>leveling up
is almost impossible.</b>

01:01.907 --> 01:02.857
<b>AS A RESULT</b>

01:02.907 --> 01:03.907
<b>As a result,</b>

01:04.197 --> 01:06.947
<b>it's considered to be
a truly unfortunate</b>

01:06.987 --> 01:08.487
<b>and defective class.</b>

01:11.617 --> 01:12.827
<b>[girl chuckles]</b>

01:21.927 --> 01:24.927
<b>-[both breathing anxiously]
-[gulps]</b>

01:29.927 --> 01:31.637
<b>-[all breathing anxiously]
-Huh?</b>

01:34.397 --> 01:35.647
<b>[bell tolling in distance]</b>

01:35.687 --> 01:38.147
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

01:43.447 --> 01:46.317
<b>[both chuckle]</b>

01:52.197 --> 01:54.167
<b>Hmm.</b>

01:56.167 --> 01:59.757
<b>There's been a lot of talk
about this Raid Quest.</b>

01:59.797 --> 02:02.927
<b>Apparently, a clown has chosen
to join us tonight.</b>

02:03.717 --> 02:05.837
<b>Must be you, Elymas.</b>

02:06.677 --> 02:09.347
<b>There are plenty
of novices like you</b>

02:09.387 --> 02:12.637
<b>who completely underestimate
guilds and monsters.</b>

02:12.677 --> 02:14.847
<b>-[all gasp]
-You managed to beat</b>

02:14.887 --> 02:17.107
<b>an Ariandype at Level 12?</b>

02:17.147 --> 02:18.857
<b>That means nothing to me!</b>

02:18.897 --> 02:21.477
<b>Adventuring isn't so easy!</b>

02:21.527 --> 02:23.147
<b>I'll teach you a lesson,</b>

02:23.187 --> 02:25.107
<b>one you aren't ever
going to forget!</b>

02:25.147 --> 02:27.027
<b>[strains quietly]</b>

02:27.657 --> 02:29.487
<b>[growling]</b>

02:31.907 --> 02:34.457
<b>[growling]</b>

02:41.127 --> 02:42.457
<b>[ELYMAS] Well, this sucks.</b>

02:44.877 --> 02:47.927
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

04:14.967 --> 04:18.887
<b>EPISODE 3 THE RAID QUEST</b>

04:18.937 --> 04:20.937
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

04:39.617 --> 04:41.537
<b>[growling]</b>

04:43.127 --> 04:45.667
<b>[strains quietly]</b>

04:46.957 --> 04:48.257
<b>[ELYMAS] Well, this sucks.</b>

04:49.087 --> 04:52.587
<b>But Raid Quests are
a rare chance at promotion.</b>

04:52.637 --> 04:54.547
<b>Can't afford to miss this one.</b>

04:57.967 --> 04:59.677
<b>So then...</b>

05:00.977 --> 05:03.307
<b>I look forward
to working with you, sir.</b>

05:04.227 --> 05:05.307
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:09.357 --> 05:11.357
<b>Hmm.</b>

05:11.857 --> 05:14.367
<b>Hmph! I don't like this,
but fine.</b>

05:15.197 --> 05:17.737
<b>Okay, Teal, get to it then.</b>

05:19.367 --> 05:21.157
<b>Of course, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

05:21.617 --> 05:22.707
<b>Hmm.</b>

05:23.747 --> 05:25.707
<b>[chuckles]</b>

05:27.417 --> 05:28.457
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:29.047 --> 05:30.207
<b>Search.</b>

05:35.087 --> 05:36.177
<b>[ELYMAS] Search.</b>

05:36.387 --> 05:38.677
<b>It detects creatures
in the surrounding area.</b>

05:39.967 --> 05:42.557
<b>It's a rare skill
for a low-level adventurer.</b>

05:45.937 --> 05:47.357
<b>[GOWTAN] Hmm.</b>

05:48.687 --> 05:49.937
<b>[TEAL] Hmm.</b>

05:56.617 --> 05:58.277
<b>There's a horde nearby.</b>

05:58.777 --> 06:01.037
<b>Roughly 30 enemy undead.</b>

06:01.077 --> 06:03.657
<b>Right.
That's some good work, Teal.</b>

06:03.707 --> 06:06.537
<b>[TEAL] Yes, but with
my exceptional skill,</b>

06:06.577 --> 06:08.497
<b>would you expect any less?</b>

06:08.547 --> 06:10.047
<b>I'm hoping you're so impressed</b>

06:10.087 --> 06:12.457
<b>you'll grant me that promotion
to E-rank.</b>

06:13.377 --> 06:15.507
<b>-[scoffs]
-[Teal laughs]</b>

06:15.547 --> 06:16.927
<b>And you.</b>

06:16.967 --> 06:20.347
<b>Your bizarre, unusual behavior.</b>

06:21.017 --> 06:23.017
<b>Well, it sparked
quite a number of rumors</b>

06:23.057 --> 06:26.057
<b>at the guild about you, Elymas.</b>

06:26.597 --> 06:28.857
<b>[ELYMAS] Judging by his dress
and equipment,</b>

06:28.897 --> 06:30.567
<b>he must be a Red Mage.</b>

06:31.187 --> 06:33.197
<b>They have strong
physical abilities,</b>

06:33.237 --> 06:35.907
<b>they can cast attack
and healing spells,</b>

06:35.947 --> 06:38.657
<b>and use a broad range
of support spells.</b>

06:38.697 --> 06:42.947
<b>I feel bad for you
being in a defective class.</b>

06:42.997 --> 06:44.787
<b>Your concern is appreciated.</b>

06:45.617 --> 06:49.247
<b>That said, I'm actually
quite happy with this class.</b>

06:51.337 --> 06:52.757
<b>[laughs]</b>

06:54.627 --> 06:55.677
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:56.217 --> 06:58.927
<b>[grunts, scoffs]</b>

06:58.967 --> 07:00.177
<b>You think you're tough?</b>

07:01.137 --> 07:03.717
<b>Well, just don't hold us back,
you hear?</b>

07:07.057 --> 07:09.147
<b>[Elymas sighs] What's his deal?</b>

07:09.187 --> 07:10.317
<b>If anything,</b>

07:10.397 --> 07:12.397
<b>Red Mage is the more
challenging class.</b>

07:13.317 --> 07:15.647
<b>At first glance,
they seem to be capable</b>

07:15.697 --> 07:16.987
<b>of almost anything.</b>

07:17.407 --> 07:18.987
<b>But in the game, they were known</b>

07:19.027 --> 07:21.117
<b>as the typical
jack-of-all-trades type.</b>

07:21.987 --> 07:24.077
<b>But this world isn't the game.</b>

07:24.537 --> 07:27.707
<b>Naturally, people favor classes
that are easy to use.</b>

07:35.087 --> 07:37.177
<b>Now everybody listen up!</b>

07:37.217 --> 07:41.547
<b>This undead horde we're facing
has a leader. A Ghoul Head!</b>

07:41.597 --> 07:43.597
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
That's a strong monster.</b>

07:43.637 --> 07:45.307
<b>As a D-rank adventurer,</b>

07:45.347 --> 07:47.227
<b>the Ghoul Head's
my responsibility.</b>

07:47.267 --> 07:49.517
<b>Yours is, stay out of my way
and fight the horde!</b>

07:49.557 --> 07:51.107
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
You won't protect us?</b>

07:51.147 --> 07:53.267
<b>Not if you get caught
between me and my foe!</b>

07:53.317 --> 07:55.027
<b>-[all gasp]
-Seriously?</b>

07:55.067 --> 07:56.397
<b>[ADVENTURER 2]
I'm staying in the back.</b>

07:56.447 --> 07:59.067
<b>So then, Mr. Gowtan is only
focusing on the boss?</b>

07:59.107 --> 08:01.867
<b>[ADVENTURER 3] I thought we'd
just have to stand next to him.</b>

08:07.287 --> 08:09.037
<b>-[growls]
-[ELYMAS] The Ghoul Head.</b>

08:09.077 --> 08:10.627
<b>It's around Level 30.</b>

08:10.997 --> 08:12.747
<b>It has no attack skills.</b>

08:12.787 --> 08:15.457
<b>But its Hades Breath skill
that turns corpses</b>

08:15.497 --> 08:18.087
<b>into low-level Wights
is a real pain.</b>

08:18.837 --> 08:21.547
<b>On the plus side,
we have Gowtan.</b>

08:21.587 --> 08:23.927
<b>A D-rank adventurer
who's around Level 40.</b>

08:24.807 --> 08:27.977
<b>If things go smoothly,
I think we can win.</b>

08:30.187 --> 08:31.477
<b>However...</b>

08:31.517 --> 08:32.807
<b>[ADVENTURER 4] We're dead.</b>

08:32.857 --> 08:34.557
<b>[ADVENTURER 5] We're definitely
going to die.</b>

08:34.607 --> 08:35.647
<b>[ELYMAS] Cowardice.</b>

08:35.687 --> 08:36.897
<b>[ADVENTURER 3]
This was a bad idea!</b>

08:36.937 --> 08:38.147
<b>[TEAL] What weaklings.</b>

08:38.187 --> 08:39.487
<b>[ADVENTURER 6] Pathetic cowards.</b>

08:40.027 --> 08:41.067
<b>ARROGANCE</b>

08:41.107 --> 08:42.527
<b>[ELYMAS] Arrogance.</b>

08:42.777 --> 08:46.617
<b>I'm dealing with scared newbies
who thought raids would be easy,</b>

08:46.657 --> 08:49.997
<b>and a careless leader
who won't look after his team.</b>

08:51.787 --> 08:54.667
<b>The odds we'll survive
are only 80%.</b>

08:56.297 --> 08:58.167
<b>That's decent for a game.</b>

08:58.547 --> 08:59.627
<b>But in this world,</b>

09:00.297 --> 09:02.177
<b>death is more
than just a setback.</b>

09:08.767 --> 09:10.727
<b>-Gowtan.
-Hmm?</b>

09:11.187 --> 09:13.477
<b>Shouldn't you be giving us
some instructions</b>

09:13.517 --> 09:15.687
<b>that are more
detailed and specific?</b>

09:16.227 --> 09:17.767
<b>[all gasp in disbelief]</b>

09:20.437 --> 09:21.447
<b>What did you say?</b>

09:21.487 --> 09:23.777
<b>The report
about the undead horde.</b>

09:23.817 --> 09:25.947
<b>What if it isn't
completely accurate, sir?</b>

09:25.987 --> 09:29.077
<b>It'll be far too late if we wait
for the worst to happen.</b>

09:29.117 --> 09:30.907
<b>[growls]</b>

09:30.957 --> 09:31.907
<b>[all gasp]</b>

09:31.957 --> 09:32.957
<b>[ADVENTURER 2]
What is he saying?</b>

09:33.077 --> 09:34.787
<b>Is he making a suggestion
to Gowtan?</b>

09:34.827 --> 09:35.957
<b>[ADVENTURER 1] Is he insane?</b>

09:35.997 --> 09:37.497
<b>[growls]</b>

09:38.797 --> 09:42.337
<b>What? You're telling me
how to run a Raid Quest?!</b>

09:42.967 --> 09:44.637
<b>[all gasp]</b>

09:45.007 --> 09:46.757
<b>[both chuckle]</b>

09:49.177 --> 09:50.767
<b>[growls]</b>

09:51.307 --> 09:53.137
<b>-[ELYMAS] No.
-Hmm?</b>

09:53.637 --> 09:56.107
<b>[ELYMAS] I'm just anxious
because unlike you,</b>

09:56.147 --> 09:58.227
<b>I'm inexperienced and low-level.</b>

09:58.897 --> 10:00.357
<b>[growls]</b>

10:00.397 --> 10:02.567
<b>So are all of the others
here tonight.</b>

10:03.317 --> 10:05.237
<b>For a veteran adventurer
like yourself,</b>

10:05.277 --> 10:07.327
<b>this raid
might be business as usual.</b>

10:07.367 --> 10:08.367
<b>[growls]</b>

10:08.447 --> 10:10.787
<b>But we'd appreciate
more instructions.</b>

10:10.827 --> 10:12.367
<b>[gasps sharply]</b>

10:12.407 --> 10:14.537
<b>[Gowtan growls]</b>

10:14.827 --> 10:18.787
<b>Hmm. I'm not your
damn babysitter, but fine!</b>

10:18.837 --> 10:19.797
<b>[all sigh with relief]</b>

10:19.837 --> 10:21.257
<b>-[TEAL] Hold up!
-[ALL] Huh?</b>

10:22.087 --> 10:24.507
<b>We don't need instructions.</b>

10:26.047 --> 10:27.507
<b>[Elymas sighs]</b>

10:28.007 --> 10:30.757
<b>Maybe you would,
given your class,</b>

10:30.807 --> 10:33.677
<b>but the rest of us aren't scared
of a few weak undead.</b>

10:33.727 --> 10:35.807
<b>Crying to Gowtan already?</b>

10:35.847 --> 10:38.607
<b>That's even before we faced
a single monster.</b>

10:39.107 --> 10:40.687
<b>[sighs in annoyance]</b>

10:41.647 --> 10:43.647
<b>[all whimper anxiously]</b>

10:44.397 --> 10:45.737
<b>[GOWTAN] Hmm.</b>

10:46.647 --> 10:48.157
<b>[chuckles gleefully]</b>

10:48.827 --> 10:50.077
<b>Ignore this fool.</b>

10:50.157 --> 10:52.867
<b>We don't need any more
instructions, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

10:53.327 --> 10:55.287
<b>If there are more cowards
like Elymas,</b>

10:55.327 --> 10:57.957
<b>stay out of our way
and run to the rear.</b>

10:58.337 --> 11:01.037
<b>-Isn't that right, Mr. Gowtan?
-Hmm.</b>

11:01.707 --> 11:02.627
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:02.667 --> 11:04.717
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

11:07.297 --> 11:09.257
<b>-[all whimper anxiously]
-[TEAL] When did they get here?</b>

11:09.297 --> 11:11.637
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

11:15.057 --> 11:16.097
<b>[GOWTAN] Hmm.</b>

11:17.437 --> 11:19.557
<b>[gasping in terror]</b>

11:24.357 --> 11:26.277
<b>[whimpering]</b>

11:27.027 --> 11:28.367
<b>[gasps]</b>

11:28.407 --> 11:29.947
<b>-[sword clinks]
-[grunts]</b>

11:31.157 --> 11:32.367
<b>[grunts]</b>

11:32.407 --> 11:34.747
<b>[growling]</b>

11:38.077 --> 11:40.957
<b>[roars]</b>

11:46.627 --> 11:47.837
<b>Ignore this fool.</b>

11:47.967 --> 11:50.597
<b>We don't need any more
instructions, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

11:50.637 --> 11:53.097
<b>If there are more cowards
like Elymas,</b>

11:53.137 --> 11:55.307
<b>stay out of our way
and run to the rear.</b>

11:56.177 --> 11:58.137
<b>-Isn't that right, Mr. Gowtan?
-Hmm.</b>

11:59.437 --> 12:00.437
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:00.477 --> 12:03.147
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

12:03.187 --> 12:05.107
<b>[all whimpering anxiously]</b>

12:05.147 --> 12:07.527
<b>[♪ ominous music playing]</b>

12:09.027 --> 12:10.067
<b>[GOWTAN] Hmm.</b>

12:12.117 --> 12:13.657
<b>[gasping in terror]</b>

12:13.697 --> 12:16.447
<b>[growling]</b>

12:19.037 --> 12:20.957
<b>[whimpering]</b>

12:20.997 --> 12:22.537
<b>[shrieks]</b>

12:22.587 --> 12:24.417
<b>-[sword clinks]
-[grunts]</b>

12:25.337 --> 12:26.547
<b>[grunts]</b>

12:26.587 --> 12:28.757
<b>[growling]</b>

12:30.507 --> 12:32.597
<b>[roars]</b>

12:32.637 --> 12:34.007
<b>[yelps]</b>

12:34.047 --> 12:36.217
<b>-[shrieks]
-Get back up!</b>

12:36.267 --> 12:38.177
<b>-[both gasp]
-[GOWTAN] Teal! Paul!</b>

12:38.227 --> 12:41.097
<b>-Clear the way for me now!
-[BOTH] What?</b>

12:41.477 --> 12:42.647
<b>Follow my lead!</b>

12:42.687 --> 12:44.147
<b>-[PAUL] Yes, sir!
-[grunts]</b>

12:44.727 --> 12:46.977
<b>[whimpering]</b>

12:47.027 --> 12:49.237
<b>[Wight snarling]</b>

12:49.817 --> 12:52.867
<b>[snarling]</b>

12:54.277 --> 12:55.867
<b>[growls]</b>

12:58.037 --> 13:00.867
<b>[ELYMAS] Its club doesn't seem
to be anything special at all.</b>

13:02.077 --> 13:03.287
<b>They should be fine.</b>

13:03.327 --> 13:05.337
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

13:06.667 --> 13:07.797
<b>All right, guys.</b>

13:07.957 --> 13:10.167
<b>Let's take care
of the Ghoul Head's followers.</b>

13:10.217 --> 13:11.297
<b>[ALL] Huh?</b>

13:11.717 --> 13:14.597
<b>Wait, you want us to charge
into all of those monsters?</b>

13:15.177 --> 13:16.467
<b>[ADVENTURER 2]
What should we do?</b>

13:16.507 --> 13:18.347
<b>Look, they may just be Wights,</b>

13:18.387 --> 13:20.767
<b>but we're all dead meat
if they surround us.</b>

13:20.807 --> 13:22.387
<b>I only came 'cause I thought</b>

13:22.437 --> 13:24.517
<b>Mr. Gowtan was gonna
take them out for us!</b>

13:24.557 --> 13:27.357
<b>I didn't know he was
gonna focus on the boss.</b>

13:28.147 --> 13:29.607
<b>[ELYMAS] So that's it.</b>

13:30.567 --> 13:32.657
<b>No wonder
they're so unmotivated.</b>

13:34.407 --> 13:35.697
<b>[ADVENTURER 4]
You've gotta be kidding me.</b>

13:36.407 --> 13:37.867
<b>[ELYMAS]
They're so inexperienced.</b>

13:37.907 --> 13:40.117
<b>They've never faced
a monster horde before,</b>

13:41.407 --> 13:43.247
<b>let alone creepy undead.</b>

13:44.457 --> 13:46.497
<b>And without proper instructions,</b>

13:46.537 --> 13:49.087
<b>I can understand
why they're so hesitant.</b>

13:49.127 --> 13:51.507
<b>-[all whimpering anxiously]
-[sighs]</b>

13:51.547 --> 13:54.337
<b>-[ELYMAS] Listen up.
-[ALL] Huh?</b>

13:55.047 --> 13:57.007
<b>You'll form into
two teams of three.</b>

13:57.047 --> 13:58.847
<b>-[ALL] Huh?
-If we start watching</b>

13:58.887 --> 14:00.517
<b>each other's backs,
we can keep the Wights</b>

14:00.557 --> 14:01.807
<b>from overwhelming us.</b>

14:01.847 --> 14:03.807
<b>[both trembling]</b>

14:03.847 --> 14:05.477
<b>[both trembling]</b>

14:05.517 --> 14:07.517
<b>-Hmm.
-Hmm.</b>

14:08.817 --> 14:10.187
<b>Fine. We'll do it.</b>

14:10.227 --> 14:13.067
<b>But what about you?
Where will you be?</b>

14:13.607 --> 14:16.527
<b>I'll be drawing undead
to me on the front line.</b>

14:16.567 --> 14:18.827
<b>I'll buy time for you
to rally yourselves.</b>

14:19.737 --> 14:22.037
<b>Look, you seem
to have some experience, friend,</b>

14:22.077 --> 14:23.747
<b>but it's reckless
to do that alone.</b>

14:23.787 --> 14:25.627
<b>[ADVENTURER 3] You won't be able
to heal fast enough.</b>

14:25.667 --> 14:28.627
<b>And aside from all of that,
aren't you a slow Heavy Knight?</b>

14:28.667 --> 14:30.797
<b>-[growls]
-Ah!</b>

14:30.837 --> 14:32.087
<b>♪</b>

14:33.217 --> 14:35.507
<b>-[Elymas grunts] Parry!
-[sword clangs]</b>

14:36.967 --> 14:38.507
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:39.007 --> 14:40.717
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE] Skill: Parry.</b>

14:40.757 --> 14:41.887
<b>Use a sword or shield</b>

14:42.097 --> 14:44.927
<b>to deflect enemy attacks
and create openings.</b>

14:44.977 --> 14:47.017
<b>[snarling]</b>

14:47.767 --> 14:48.897
<b>[grunts]</b>

14:48.937 --> 14:50.647
<b>[panting]</b>

14:50.687 --> 14:52.487
<b>-[sword clangs]
-[grunts]</b>

14:53.147 --> 14:56.147
<b>Parry! [panting]</b>

14:56.197 --> 14:57.487
<b>[grunts] Parry!</b>

14:59.237 --> 15:00.277
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:01.237 --> 15:02.787
<b>Disarm!</b>

15:04.747 --> 15:05.787
<b>[huffs]</b>

15:06.247 --> 15:07.747
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

15:09.337 --> 15:12.837
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:13.627 --> 15:14.717
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:15.337 --> 15:17.927
<b>Rampart Reflection!</b>

15:18.757 --> 15:20.177
<b>[Wights snarling]</b>

15:20.217 --> 15:21.807
<b>RAMPART REFLECTION</b>

15:22.427 --> 15:23.727
<b>[Wight growls]</b>

15:24.517 --> 15:25.807
<b>[sighs]</b>

15:27.767 --> 15:28.807
<b>[all gasping]</b>

15:28.897 --> 15:30.357
<b>[ADVENTURER 1]
He did that by himself?</b>

15:32.017 --> 15:33.067
<b>Don't worry.</b>

15:33.397 --> 15:36.277
<b>It's a Heavy Knight's job
to attract enemy hordes.</b>

15:36.317 --> 15:38.107
<b>Don't let your guards down.</b>

15:38.147 --> 15:40.617
<b>And if you see anything strange,
tell the others.</b>

15:40.987 --> 15:42.737
<b>I'll give what help I can.</b>

15:42.787 --> 15:44.867
<b>-[ADVENTURER 1] What?
-[all gasping]</b>

15:46.787 --> 15:49.877
<b>-[sword clanging]
-[monsters growling]</b>

15:53.207 --> 15:54.417
<b>[sighs]</b>

15:58.507 --> 16:02.047
<b>How's a defective class
taking out so many Wights alone?</b>

16:02.507 --> 16:05.057
<b>Isn't he just an F-rank
Heavy Knight?</b>

16:13.477 --> 16:16.027
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level 16 has been reached.</b>

16:16.687 --> 16:20.527
<b>[ELYMAS] Good. Parry's working
even better than I expected.</b>

16:21.617 --> 16:24.867
<b>And fighting this many enemies
at this level is efficient.</b>

16:26.787 --> 16:28.537
<b>Display stats.</b>

16:28.997 --> 16:30.167
<b>ELYMAS EDVAUGHN
ATTACK DEFENSE MAGIC SPEED</b>

16:30.207 --> 16:31.167
<b>CLASS: HEAVY KNIGHT</b>

16:31.207 --> 16:32.247
<b>[ELYMAS] Nice.</b>

16:32.287 --> 16:34.377
<b>It's climbing steadily.</b>

16:35.247 --> 16:37.967
<b>He said he was gonna
draw them all to himself,</b>

16:38.007 --> 16:40.547
<b>but he's practically mowing
all of them down.</b>

16:40.587 --> 16:42.087
<b>[ADVENTURER 3] I don't know
if we should stick</b>

16:42.137 --> 16:43.347
<b>-behind him or not.
-[all chattering]</b>

16:43.387 --> 16:44.547
<b>This guy's really strong,</b>

16:44.807 --> 16:46.717
<b>but he's starting to scare me
more than the Wights.</b>

16:46.767 --> 16:47.927
<b>[ELYMAS] Seriously?</b>

16:47.977 --> 16:50.017
<b>[♪ adventurous music playing]</b>

16:52.017 --> 16:53.977
<b>[grunts]</b>

16:54.017 --> 16:55.977
<b>[both panting]</b>

16:56.017 --> 16:58.647
<b>[both panting]</b>

16:59.027 --> 16:59.987
<b>[Elymas grunts]</b>

17:00.027 --> 17:02.027
<b>[cape rustling]</b>

17:02.777 --> 17:03.987
<b>[sighs]</b>

17:09.247 --> 17:10.407
<b>[ELYMAS] That's most of them.</b>

17:13.747 --> 17:15.167
<b>[ADVENTURER 4] Um, Mr. Elymas,</b>

17:15.207 --> 17:17.417
<b>should we go and help
Mr. Gowtan now?</b>

17:17.457 --> 17:18.837
<b>The Ghoul Head?</b>

17:19.167 --> 17:21.167
<b>It's a much higher level
than we are.</b>

17:22.717 --> 17:24.507
<b>Let's leave it to Gowtan
to handle.</b>

17:27.427 --> 17:28.767
<b>[panting]</b>

17:28.807 --> 17:30.477
<b>[growling]</b>

17:34.897 --> 17:37.897
<b>-[growls]
-[grunts]</b>

17:39.187 --> 17:41.487
<b>[both grunting]</b>

17:44.867 --> 17:47.487
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:47.537 --> 17:49.697
<b>[yells]</b>

17:51.707 --> 17:53.827
<b>[grunts, pants]</b>

17:55.207 --> 17:57.667
<b>[growling]</b>

18:00.667 --> 18:03.217
<b>[roars]</b>

18:03.257 --> 18:05.757
<b>[grunts]
You still won't go down?</b>

18:05.797 --> 18:07.217
<b>Stubborn monster!</b>

18:07.677 --> 18:09.807
<b>-[grunts]
-[slashes]</b>

18:09.847 --> 18:11.217
<b>Teal! Paul!</b>

18:11.267 --> 18:13.137
<b>Draw more Wights to yourselves!</b>

18:13.177 --> 18:14.977
<b>[whimpering in fright]</b>

18:15.687 --> 18:17.687
<b>Why are you two
being such cowards?!</b>

18:18.227 --> 18:21.227
<b>If you don't step up,
I won't give you that promotion!</b>

18:21.277 --> 18:23.237
<b>Please understand, Mr. Gowtan.</b>

18:23.277 --> 18:25.027
<b>If we get any closer
to the Ghoul Head,</b>

18:25.067 --> 18:27.027
<b>and we get caught in the fight,
we're no good to you.</b>

18:27.077 --> 18:28.327
<b>Besides,</b>

18:28.367 --> 18:30.787
<b>we can assist from here. [gasps]</b>

18:30.827 --> 18:32.697
<b>-[scoffs]
-[growls]</b>

18:33.457 --> 18:35.157
<b>[grunts]</b>

18:38.247 --> 18:39.297
<b>[grunts]</b>

18:40.127 --> 18:41.167
<b>[grunts]</b>

18:42.457 --> 18:45.007
<b>[yelling]</b>

18:45.927 --> 18:47.927
<b>-[grunts]
-[slashes]</b>

18:47.967 --> 18:49.427
<b>[GOWTAN] Rock Shatterer!</b>

18:49.467 --> 18:51.517
<b>[groaning]</b>

18:55.057 --> 18:56.517
<b>[both gasp]</b>

18:56.557 --> 18:57.977
<b>-[all gasp]
-Yeah!</b>

18:58.017 --> 18:59.067
<b>Display stats.</b>

18:59.607 --> 19:00.567
<b>[Ghoul Head groaning]</b>

19:00.607 --> 19:01.567
<b>MONSTER: GHOUL HEAD</b>

19:01.607 --> 19:02.687
<b>[ELYMAS] All right.</b>

19:03.147 --> 19:04.687
<b>With one more hit,</b>

19:04.737 --> 19:07.407
<b>Gowtan could knock out
its remaining HP.</b>

19:08.067 --> 19:09.117
<b>But still...</b>

19:09.157 --> 19:10.367
<b>-[Wight snarls]
-[Gowtan gasps]</b>

19:10.407 --> 19:11.577
<b>[both gasp]</b>

19:11.617 --> 19:14.037
<b>-[Wights snarling]
-[grunts]</b>

19:14.907 --> 19:16.497
<b>Those Wights are in the way.</b>

19:16.537 --> 19:18.457
<b>[Teal, Paul whimpering]</b>

19:18.497 --> 19:20.997
<b>Um, should we go
attack the Wights?</b>

19:21.047 --> 19:22.877
<b>No, we wait here.</b>

19:22.917 --> 19:25.007
<b>-[Ghoul Head growls]
-[gasps]</b>

19:25.047 --> 19:26.677
<b>[all gasp]</b>

19:26.717 --> 19:28.297
<b>[growls]</b>

19:30.177 --> 19:32.177
<b>[chomping]</b>

19:32.217 --> 19:34.717
<b>[growls]</b>

19:34.767 --> 19:36.687
<b>[grunts]</b>

19:36.727 --> 19:38.597
<b>[Teal, Paul gasp]</b>

19:39.107 --> 19:40.357
<b>-[Ghoul Head growls]
-[Gowtan gasps]</b>

19:40.977 --> 19:43.317
<b>[growls]</b>

19:43.357 --> 19:45.777
<b>[all whimpering]</b>

19:45.817 --> 19:47.857
<b>[Ghoul Head growls]</b>

19:49.487 --> 19:51.907
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

19:51.947 --> 19:54.367
<b>-[chomping]
-[all whimpering]</b>

19:54.407 --> 19:56.447
<b>[ADVENTURER 1] It healed?</b>

19:56.497 --> 19:58.747
<b>The Consume Corpses skill.</b>

19:59.917 --> 20:03.207
<b>It helps recover HP by eating
corpses and the undead.</b>

20:03.707 --> 20:06.127
<b>There's a low chance
for Ghoul Heads to have it.</b>

20:08.127 --> 20:10.637
<b>Still, that's odd.</b>

20:10.677 --> 20:12.637
<b>Consume Corpses
shouldn't require it</b>

20:12.677 --> 20:14.517
<b>to eat so many undead to heal.</b>

20:14.557 --> 20:17.767
<b>This doesn't make sense.
Unless...</b>

20:17.807 --> 20:18.887
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:22.517 --> 20:23.567
<b>[grunts]</b>

20:24.107 --> 20:27.487
<b>[roars]</b>

20:27.527 --> 20:28.897
<b>[all gasp]</b>

20:28.947 --> 20:29.987
<b>Could it be?</b>

20:30.027 --> 20:31.157
<b>It may have healed,</b>

20:31.447 --> 20:34.077
<b>but at least now all those
damnable Wights are gone.</b>

20:34.117 --> 20:35.327
<b>[grunts]</b>

20:35.367 --> 20:36.697
<b>Gowtan, stop!</b>

20:36.747 --> 20:38.247
<b>Get away from that thing!</b>

20:38.287 --> 20:41.167
<b>[Gowtan grunts] I'll settle this
once and for all!</b>

20:41.207 --> 20:42.627
<b>[roars]</b>

20:42.667 --> 20:44.587
<b>[all whimpering]</b>

20:44.627 --> 20:46.497
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

20:46.547 --> 20:47.587
<b>[gasps]</b>

20:48.507 --> 20:53.047
<b>[roaring]</b>

20:58.307 --> 21:00.347
<b>[grunting]</b>

21:06.977 --> 21:10.737
<b>[roars]</b>

21:11.647 --> 21:12.987
<b>[gasps]</b>

21:14.157 --> 21:15.197
<b>What?!</b>

21:17.577 --> 21:20.457
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE] Ghoul Head
has evolved into Mad Headder.</b>

21:20.497 --> 21:22.417
<b>Level 40 has been reached.</b>

21:22.457 --> 21:23.417
<b>GHOUL HEAD HAS EVOLVED
INTO MAD HEADDER</b>

21:23.457 --> 21:25.337
<b>[all gasp in horror]</b>

21:25.377 --> 21:27.417
<b>[both whimpering]</b>

21:27.877 --> 21:29.087
<b>[gasps]</b>

21:29.507 --> 21:32.137
<b>-[Mad Headder roars]
-[breathing heavily]</b>

21:33.887 --> 21:36.887
<b>[laughing]</b>

21:39.847 --> 21:42.937
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:12.227 --> 23:14.777
<b>[ELYMAS] A rare monster
has leveled up,</b>

23:14.817 --> 23:16.647
<b>and the situation
couldn't be worse.</b>

23:16.697 --> 23:20.197
<b>After evolving, the Mad Headder
is now even more powerful</b>

23:20.237 --> 23:21.907
<b>than the high-level Gowtan.</b>

23:21.947 --> 23:25.287
<b>F-rank adventurers like us
are no match for it.</b>

23:25.327 --> 23:27.537
<b>If I take a single direct hit,</b>

23:27.577 --> 23:28.787
<b>I'll die.</b>

23:30.747 --> 23:33.297
<b>Next time,
"Existence Evolution."</b>

23:34.087 --> 23:38.007
<b>Even so, this kind of situation
really fires me up!</b>
